nc-contract-ghost-role-requirements-failed = You do not meet the requirements for this ghost role.

nc-contract-ghost-role-raider-name = Wasteland Raider
nc-contract-ghost-role-raider-description = You are a wasteland raider. Reach the city, act in the interests of your gang, and try to survive. A contract has been issued on you, so bounty hunters may come after you.
nc-contract-ghost-role-raider-rules = Act in the interests of the raiders and try to survive. Normal server and ghost-role rules still apply.

nc-contract-ghost-role-wanted-rules =
    You are a free antagonist: you choose whether to act peacefully or aggressively. Your main goal is to survive by any means.
    You may attack first only in response to aggression, refusal to follow your demand, or an obvious hunt against you. While the hunt continues, you and the hunters may kill each other without full escalation; this does not apply to random bystanders.
    You may rob alone only to survive: for medicine, weapons, ammunition, or other needed resources. Robbery purely for profit is forbidden.
    Do not approach or enter faction outposts or bases.
    Do not destroy or hide other people's bodies.
    You may team up with other wanted people, but they may betray or rob you.
    About one hour later, when the contract on you expires, these special rules stop applying and you become an ordinary wastelander.
